{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","title":"sourceUrl","required":true,"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsCore"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore13PlayerAdapterP9sourceUrlSSSgvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sourceUrl"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/playeradapter\/sourceurl"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceUrl","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK lends the content player to an ad on the shared-element path (the ad plays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the content player so it reaches the layer system picture-in-picture is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presenting) and has to give it back afterwards. Only the adapter knows what to give","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"back, and it must read that from the PLAYER rather than remember what was passed to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"load(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": integrators legitimately call ","type":"text"},{"code":"replaceCurrentItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" themselves — the demo","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"does — so an adapter tracking only its own calls would report the wrong asset, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An adapter that cannot answer returns nil and simply does not get shared-element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insertion; ","type":"text"},{"code":"DA-SHARED-ELEMENT-UNSUPPORTED","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" explains why.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter\/sourceUrl","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"title":"PlayerAdapter Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter\/sourceUrl-409i3"],"anchor":"PlayerAdapter-Implementations"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore","doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional: the URL this adapter is currently playing — the ASSET, not a surface."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore":{"url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadscore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The portable, player-agnostic types of the OptiView Ads SDK: the break-manifest model, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlayerAdapter"},{"type":"text","text":" contract every content player implements, and the diagnostic taxonomy."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore","type":"topic","title":"OptiViewAdsCore","role":"collection"},"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore/PlayerAdapter/sourceUrl":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter\/sourceUrl","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":